[gd_scene load_steps=12 format=3]

; GENERATED â€” grass, ferns, bushes, flowers and rocks scattered through the village so the ground
; reads as lived-in rather than as a flat texture.
;
; Placement avoids building footprints, the dirt path, every NPC's standing spot, and the carved
; heart behind the mill â€” a bush swallowing the optional discovery would be the "visible but
; unusable" bug class, so the keep-out list is part of the generator, not an afterthought.
;
; NO COLLISION, deliberately: the player must be able to walk over grass. Collision on scatter
; would also snag the CharacterBody3D capsule, which is the seam-freeze class this project has
; already paid for once (see godot-multisegment-terrain).
;
; Deterministic: fixed-seed LCG (seed 20260814). Regenerating gives the same layout.
